    "text": "The sum of the distinct real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi></math> for which the vectors&nbsp;<math><mi>&#956;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> are co-planar, is&nbsp;"
